==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*4 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bears Be Bare]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

