==Strategy==
Bears Be Bare may seem threatening, but they're more a support unit to allow the others to progress. Start by stalling the opening enemies to get a good cash flow. Bears Be Bare outranges many of your units, so it's highly recommended to use any and all spammable attackers and rushers that you have. Neither Gabriels nor Aku Doges are seriously threatening, as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or similar can endlessly knockback Gabriel, and Aku Doge just needs a good hitter. Take advantage of Bears be Bare's many knockbacks to either stop it from attacking, or expose the Heavenly Hippoes behind it.

